00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:29.290
It's like a book you'd see in the store!

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:33.830
No... the big sellers at Mujimuji Ryohin

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:33.830
are the ones that aren't too hard to make.

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:43.120
Sure enough, I haven't got it.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:43.870
Huh?

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:47.910
This artwork still isn't enough to capture your grace!

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:51.000
Your cuteness! Your charm!

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:53.120
The feeling of just wanting to hold you tight!

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:54.370
Huh...?

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:05.500
Th-that's why... I-I'd like to have you model for me.

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:07.700
Huh? Un modèle?!

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:09.290
POTATO

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:09.290
CHIPS

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:10.830
FROZEN

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:10.830
POTATO

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:10.830
CHIPS

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:12.750
POTATO

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:12.750
CHIPS

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:17.700
M-Master! I'm sorry! That's fine for now!

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:20.000
Huh? I was no good?

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:24.120
Being a model sure is hard, huh?

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:27.660
I'm sorry, Master! Please, just act normal.

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:29.750
I'll take care of the posing on my end.

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:32.790
Huh? Still, I'll be thinking about you being there...

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:33.950
Not to worry!

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:37.370
Removing all trace of my presence is my special skill!

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:41.160
Is that really a "special skill"?

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.700
Squeak, squeak. Squeak, squeak.

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:09.660
Master is right here in front of me, and she's so cute,

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:09.660
but I just can't capture her expressions.

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:12.790
Is this a lack of my own abilities?

00:12:13.410 --> 00:12:16.120
Still, I'm sure that with more observation, I will...

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:19.080
Yes, I must watch her even more closely!

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:20.370
More closely...

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:22.120
MORE CLOSELY!

00:12:22.120 --> 00:12:23.870
Umaruuun!

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:26.330
Umaru?!

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:27.410
Huh?

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:30.870
Wait, what? Kirie?

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:34.200
I-I'm sorry, Master! I didn't mean to wake you!

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:36.500
What was that just now?

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:41.660
Even if Master Komaru is

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:41.660
Umaru's younger sister, that was...!

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:44.370
I'm home.

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:50.080
That was super fast!

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:51.660
It's good to see you, Kirie.

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:53.660
S-sorry for the bother!

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:57.500
Here. I got you a new flavor of potato chips.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:00.290
Huh? A new flavor?!

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:03.950
But we're about to have dinner,

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:03.950
so you can't eat them today.

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:06.450
Yes, I know, Big Brother.

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:08.200
Oh...

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:13.290
Master's biggest smile is when her older brother is here.

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:15.700
Kirie, you should join...!

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:19.330
Um, join us for dinner.

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:23.660
No! I must go home and start drawing immediately!

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:25.620
Drawing what?

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:35.540
Sunday

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:41.910
Huh?

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:43.120
Umaru.

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:50.410
This says there's a new Western-style restaurant.

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:50.410
How about we have lunch there while we're shopping?

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:53.950
I'm just gonna... sleep.

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:56.540
Oh... okay...

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:06.620
That Umaru, I swear.

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:09.950
This whole spring break, all she's done is sleep.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:13.330
I can understand that she's sleepy, but still...

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:17.540
she should dress up a little

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:17.540
and go have fun with her friends.

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:19.370
Ah, Taihei!

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:22.200
Good afternoon!

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:24.040
Hi, Ebina.

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:30.540
That's pretty responsible of you

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:30.540
to always do the shopping yourself.

00:14:30.540 --> 00:14:33.160
No, not at all. Also...

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:36.200
Range-Tei

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:38.080
Apparently, a new restaurant has opened up!

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:41.830
We live in the same complex,

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:41.830
so I guess we do a lot of the same things.

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:44.000
Also, um...

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:48.200
it might be the restaurant where my big brother works.

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:54.700
Um, Ebina...

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:05.910
Kirie!

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:17.660
Kirie, w-wait!

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:21.660
How are you, Kirie?

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:24.660
H-h-hello, Taihei.

00:15:25.290 --> 00:15:27.700
What are you going to do with all those pens?

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:30.120
I-I...!

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:34.200
I want to be a storybook author!

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.370
Huh?

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:37.620
U-uh...

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:40.080
Th-that is...

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:47.290
Um!

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:52.660
We use them a lot in art class.

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:52.660
They're always running out.

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:57.410
Ah, they're for school, huh? That sure takes me back.

00:15:57.750 --> 00:16:00.290
Huh? But it's spring break.

00:16:01.450 --> 00:16:03.000
Well, that is...

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:05.410
Um... I mean...!

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:08.580
Western Restaurant

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:08.580
Range-Tei

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:10.410
So, Big Brother went off to eat alone, did he?!

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:15.040
Ah! There he is. And Kirie and Ebina?

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:17.500
Big Brother!

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:21.330
Umaru.

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:24.700
What's the big idea? How can you go off and eat alone?!

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:27.620
What brings you out with my brother?

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:30.790
W-well, I happened to run into him here...

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:32.830
For me, it was at the supermarket.

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:35.830
Kirie, are you buying those pens?

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:37.750
Huh?! No!

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:42.040
Kirie, I bet you could totally be a storybook author...!

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:42.950
...author...!

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:44.000
...author...!

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:44.950
...author...!

00:16:47.910 --> 00:16:52.120
I-it may be spring break, but we

00:16:47.910 --> 00:16:52.120
use them a lot in art class, don't we?

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:54.700
Huh? Art class?

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:59.330
There's something Kirie doesn't want us to know.

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:02.450
Ebina saw that and has been trying to cover for her.

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:06.290
She's not talking to Umaru and Kirie

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:06.290
about her big brother either...

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:09.450
Maybe she thinks she has to be careful

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:09.450
and not talk about these things.

00:17:12.080 --> 00:17:12.910
