00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:14.540
Y-yes?

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:16.000
You're really kind, aren't you?

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:16.580
Huh?

00:17:18.790 --> 00:17:20.250
Huuuuuuuh?!

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:23.910
Ebina, what is it?

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:25.080
Ebina!

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:30.660
Welcome.

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:36.290
It's great, isn't it, Ebina?

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:37.700
Y-yes!

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:57.160
Staaaaaaaaare

00:18:07.450 --> 00:18:10.410
I wanna turn the A/C on! I wanna turn the A/C on!

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:14.080
It's HOT, Big Brother! So hot!

00:18:14.080 --> 00:18:16.040
It's still only May, so it's too soon.

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:18.540
I was so hot last night that I couldn't sleep!

00:18:18.790 --> 00:18:21.450
And here, this is what YOU looked like!

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:24.290
When did you take that?!

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:30.040
Let's turn it on early this year! It won't cost that much

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:30.040
