00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:32.790
It's not like I'm trying to say we're broke.

00:18:33.160 --> 00:18:35.200
If you keep the A/C on all the time,

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:39.540
you'll stop being able to regulate your body heat

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:39.540
and you'll get cooling disorder.

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:41.040
I've got no strength...

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:41.000
I've got no strength...

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:42.080
I'm tired...

00:18:41.040 --> 00:18:42.200
I'm tired...

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:43.040
I'm sleepy...

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:43.540
I'm sleepy...

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:47.950
Big Brother! Big Brother! Big Brother...!

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:45.330
Big Brother!

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:46.370
Big Brother!

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:48.370
Big Brother!

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:48.370
Big Brother!

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:48.370
Big Brother!

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:48.370
Big Brother!

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:48.370
Big Brother!

00:18:46.380 --> 00:18:48.370
Big Brother!

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:51.200
That's how Big Brother sees me?

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:54.330
In any case, we're not turning on the A/C till July!

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:57.540
He's turned into some stubborn old man.

00:18:57.540 --> 00:19:01.790
Still, stubborn old men are known

00:18:57.540 --> 00:19:01.790
