00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:07.620
You sure do know a lot, Big Brother.

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:07.620
I'd never heard of cooling disorder!

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:10.830
Huh? No, I just saw it on the news.

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:16.580
Don't be modest! You have SO much knowledge

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:16.580
