00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:24.910
And you're always helping me with my studies.

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:24.910
It's such a big help!

00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:26.500
R-really?

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:28.950
So turn on the A/C.

00:19:28.950 --> 00:19:30.120
What the heck?

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:32.290
I said no, and that means NO!

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:35.000
What?! Big Brother, you're such a scrooge!

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:43.910
Ughhh... it's so hot. Big Brother, I can't sleep...

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:45.580
